  "description": "Single storey rear link infill extension; first floor rear extension alterations and extension to raise roof height of the existing first floor side extension; conversion garage to internal storage within installation of window to front; new side access door; external alterations (demolition of rear link extension)",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The alterations to the first floor side element to create a flat room form coupled with the lack of set back from the front wall, and the associated first floor flat roof in-fill rear extension would result in a cramped and obtrusive form of development and an incongruous addition that would fail to respect the character and appearance of the site and the prevailing pattern of development in the local area. As such, the works would be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D.1 and D.11 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
